-- V1-A base roles (PLAN V1-A section 3). Generated by renderBaseRoleUpdate(V1A_UPDATED_BASE_ROLES) in
-- apps/api/src/lib/permissions.ts; apps/api/src/lib/permissions.test.ts fails if this block and the catalogue differ.
-- No MFA flag changes: the roles gaining privileged permissions already require MFA; Commission analyst gains reads only.
